{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — Who caused you to be like the Cushites, who do not know Me? Your kings, for all the kings of Israel did evil; therefore I will destroy the kingdom of Israel, and there will be no king over them any longer in the exile of Samaria, and the tribes in the hand of the king of Assyria."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:39.612672998Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}